smart.description:
The solar planner that governs ECO, AUTO and AUTO-ECO. Normal and Power are left alone.

The rule is three lines:
• it starts when there is enough surplus to run the wallbox at its minimum;
• it holds at least that minimum for as long as the panels produce, even if the house is taking all the surplus — the battery makes up the difference;
• it stops only when production is over, or the home battery has fallen below its threshold.

Above the minimum the current follows the surplus, so nothing goes to the grid.

